=== Origin picture slice [12] ===

This slice is like the picture slice but its size for the purpose of of
measurement is always zero, even though the displayed picture might be
bigger than size zero, and that the origin of the picture is moved to the
position of this slice, instead of ignoring it like slice type 11 does.

